#  What never enters the build context.
#
# The Dockerfile copies named paths, so most of this is about context size.
# Two entries matter for correctness: node_modules/ from a laptop is the
# wrong platform's binaries, and dist/ from a laptop is a stale bundle that
# would otherwise be what the image ships if anyone changed the COPY lines.
#
# Patterns anchor at the context root unless they start with **/ -- the
# opposite of .gitignore.

# --- Build output and dependencies -------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/

# --- Local configuration -----------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*

# --- Not part of the bundle --------------------------------------------------
.git/
.gitignore
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
*.md
